      en: "Central Bank of Honduras is a notable location in Honduras that reflects the country's geographic and cultural diversity. The main building of the central bank, an example of brutalist architecture in Tegucigalpa. At the same time brutalist style. In addition financial center. In the surrounding area houses a numismatic museum. Another characteristic feature city landmark. In this way, Central Bank of Honduras fits naturally into the wider picture of Honduras, showing how closely linked nature, history and economy are across the country."
